      "text": "Life Manager Life Manager manages your body, mind, and money. It is a personal manager that turns goals into completed real-world actions. It acts within delegated boundaries, verifies what happened, and reports the result in plain language with evidence in Telegram. Organ What Life Manager manages Daily Calendar, event and accelerator applications, job applications, priorities, and follow-through Physical / Mental Routines, wellbeing, and continuity of care Financial Net worth, cash flow, spending, income opportunities, and risk-managed investing Open Life Manager · Start in Telegram · View t",
